| **P3 - Low** | Minor issue, enhancement | Next sprint | 0 |

## 9. Developer Fix Guidelines

### A11Y-001: Form Labels
```jsx
// ❌ Before
<input id="email" type="email" placeholder="Email" />

// ✅ After
<label htmlFor="email">Email Address</label>
<input id="email" type="email" />

// Or with aria-label
<input id="email" type="email" aria-label="Email Address" />
```

### A11Y-002: Focus Trap
```jsx
// Use focus-trap-react or implement:
useEffect(() => {
  const handleKeyDown = (e) => {
    if (e.key === 'Tab') {
      // Trap focus within modal
    }
  };
  document.addEventListener('keydown', handleKeyDown);
  return () => document.removeEventListener('keydown', handleKeyDown);
}, []);
```

### A11Y-003: Color-Independent Status
```jsx
// ❌ Before - Color only
<div className="text-red-500">Error: Invalid email</div>

// ✅ After - Icon + Text + Color
<div className="flex items-center text-red-500" role="alert">
  <AlertCircle className="w-4 h-4 mr-2" aria-hidden="true" />
  <span>Error: Invalid email address</span>
</div>
```

